{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "No home internet",
  "metadata": {
    "description": "Share of households with no internet subscription of any kind, pale to deep blue. Measured over all 239,548 block groups with a published value: 6 classes with breaks at 2%/5%/9%/14%/22%, which fall at the 35th/54th/70th/83rd/93rd percentile of the national distribution. 69.76% of block groups have a coefficient of variation above 0.3 at this geography, too many to fade without washing the map out, so read pct_no_internet_moe in the GeoParquet before drawing a conclusion from any single block group.",
    "portolan:column": "pct_no_internet",
    "portolan:breaks": [
